Modelica source:
```modelica
connector SignalPort
  Real s;
  flow Real q;
end SignalPort;
model Receiver
  SignalPort p;
end Receiver;
model Wrapper
  SignalPort boundary;
  Receiver n1;
  Receiver n2;
equation
  connect(n2.p,n1.p);
  connect(n1.p,boundary);
end Wrapper;
model Study
  Wrapper w;
end Study;
```

Question:
Within the equation scope of model instance Study.w, return the canonical signed member vector for the primitive flow connection set generated there that contains w.boundary.q.

Target:
w.boundary.q

Answer format:
Use ascending path:integer entries joined by commas without spaces; coefficients must be primitive, nonzero, and oriented so the first coefficient is positive.
Return exactly {"answer":"..."}.
